+Both commands exited 0. Both files have SHA-256
+`4ae5eadda2bc9e05737c549a4ae38413d20a0bd9a520a71bf1100855124657f0`.
+See `evidence/stage2_fidelity.sh` and `evidence/stage2_fidelity.log`.
